---
title: "withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_canceled: investor withdraws from canceled sale
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_position: isCanceled == true
    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_not_canceled: sale not canceled
    q_check_position --> q_check_not_withdrawn: position.investedCapital > 0
    q_check_position --> q_revert_no_capital: no capital to withdraw
    q_check_not_withdrawn --> q_update: not already withdrawn
    q_check_not_withdrawn --> q_revert_already: already withdrawn
    q_update --> q_transfer: amount = position.investedCapital, position.investedCapital = 0
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, amount), emit CancelWithdrawal(investor, amount)
    q_revert_not_canceled --> [*]: revert SaleNotCanceled
    q_revert_no_capital --> [*]: revert NoCapital
    q_revert_already --> [*]: revert AlreadyWithdrawn

    note right of q_update
        INV-001: Full invested capital returned on cancellation (no fees deducted)
        INV-002: State updated before transfer (CEI pattern)
    end note
